commit f4207f7e69b042447f7662b021fcf5d1e49b5a98
Author: Scott Sunarto
The guard turned b4/lore mbox series (From git@z …) into text; mbox From
lines with a date now start a message. A click in BB's preview rechecks as
a poll would, keeping validators and a running read, and the bare preview
after a failed first read rechecks too. Pin the guard's new fallbacks:
stray text before lost lines, svn property hunks, custom log formats.

